national, federal, state, provincial, or local government (including any agency,
authority, department, instrumentality or other subdivision of the foregoing)
substance ormaterial generated pursuant to 40 CFR 260.10.
iv."Universal Wastes”means those wastes defined in 40 CFR $273.9.
v. “Facility" means a storage, treatment and/or disposal facility owned or
audited and approved by CONSULTANT, and which is permitted to accept
waste materials under applicable laws and regulations.
